### Try to sign up as admin (the guard must turn this into "customer")
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "name": "Fake Admin",
  "email": "fakeadmin@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Sign up as a vendor (should stay "vendor")
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "name": "Test Vendor",
  "email": "vendor@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "role": "vendor"
}